menu "JPPDOS"

config JPP_LRV_PROVISIONING
    bool "Enable LRV EEPROM provisioning (MANUFACTURING ONLY)"
    default n
    help
        Compiles the write-once LRV provisioning path into the firmware: the
        JPPD-SMP PROVISION_LRV command (0x30) and the EEPROM identity-write
        code in jpp_lrv.

        This must be DISABLED for production firmware.  When disabled the
        firmware physically contains no code that can write the LRV identity
        region of the AT24C32 EEPROM, so a shipped device's identity can never
        be rewritten in the field.

        Manufacturing flow: build+flash a provisioning image with this option
        on, push the LRV blob with scripts/lrv_manufacturing.py, then build+
        flash the production image with this option off.

endmenu
